          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{166+170+168+67+170+169}{6}\\\\\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{910}{6}\\\\\\text{Mean}&=151\\frac{2}{3}\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThis is approximately $151.67\\text{ cm}$ to two decimal places.\n\nOrdered heights: $67,\\ 166,\\ 168,\\ 169,\\ 170,\\ 170\\text{ cm}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{168+169}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=168.5\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe most frequent height is $170\\text{ cm}$, so the mode is $170\\text{ cm}$.",
