          "worked": "Remaining heights in order: $166,\\ 168,\\ 169,\\ 170,\\ 170\\text{ cm}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{166+168+169+170+170}{5}\\\\\\text{Mean}&=\\frac{843}{5}\\\\\\text{Mean}&=168.6\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe middle height is $169\\text{ cm}$, so the median is $169\\text{ cm}$. The most frequent height is $170\\text{ cm}$, so the mode is $170\\text{ cm}$.\n\nThe mean increases considerably, from $151\\frac{2}{3}\\text{ cm}$ to $168.6\\text{ cm}$. The median increases from $168.5\\text{ cm}$ to $169\\text{ cm}$, a rise of $0.5\\text{ cm}$. The mode is unchanged.",
